        "observations": {
          "desktop_closed": "Three differently sized pyramids on dune-like relief, ivory/honey strata, blue lid borders, brass clasp and side ring, and rounded pale feet preserve the reference identity.",
          "desktop_open": "Empty stone-lined cavity and veined lid underside are visible; dark rim strips meet pale corner blocks abruptly, with a conspicuous rear-right notch/junction.",
          "marketing": "Three pyramids, thin blue lid outline and broad blue seam band, flowing tan strata, brass fittings and squat rounded feet match the principal model features.",
          "mobile_closed": "Complete pyramids, feet and body fit; title wraps cleanly. Dark under-lid seam looks pronounced but matches a blue band in the reference.",
          "mobile_open": "Full raised lid and body are visible without clipping; small rim joins and metal details are jagged, and veining is repetitive."
        },
